{"id": "conard-house-late-audit-filings", "title": "Conard House filed six federal audit forms beyond nine months", "seconds": 60.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "3fee4029bc8429d3", "words": 163, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Conard House operated supportive housing in San Francisco.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.56, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "early", "kicker": "McAllister Hotel", "text": "Supportive housing", "mark": "File 240339"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.81, 1.29, 1.77, 2.15, 2.27, 2.45]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Its June 2022 audit arrived nine months behind the city schedule.", "t0": 3.68, "t1": 7.53, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "9 months late", "label": "City audit completion standard"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.54, 0.85, 1.39, 1.76, 2.19, 2.45, 2.74, 3.02, 3.13, 3.38]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By July 2024, the next audit was still outstanding.", "t0": 7.65, "t1": 11.27, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "city", "kicker": "City monitoring letter", "text": "Outstanding audit", "mark": "July 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.54, 0.82, 1.81, 1.97, 2.26, 2.54, 2.68, 2.92]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Monitors counted nine days of operating cash against a 30-day benchmark.", "t0": 11.39, "t1": 15.34, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "9 days", "label": "30-day operating cash benchmark"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.92, 1.2, 1.49, 1.63, 2.06, 2.37, 2.72, 2.82, 3.37]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "They reported $1.1 million in cash outflow even as operating results stayed positive.", "t0": 15.46, "t1": 21.64, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.1 million", "label": "Two years of net cash outflow"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.72, 0.94, 1.24, 1.47, 1.8, 2.14, 2.25, 2.59, 3.56, 3.9, 4.08, 4.54, 4.92, 5.27]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Auditors also found accounts reconciled only after year end.", "t0": 21.86, "t1": 25.43, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy24", "kicker": "Financial statements", "text": "Accounts reconciled", "mark": "finding 2024-001"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.78, 1.0, 1.45, 2.16, 2.44, 2.73, 3.02]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A later audit recorded that the reconciliation problem had been resolved.", "t0": 25.55, "t1": 29.11, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy25", "kicker": "Prior findings", "text": "Reconciliation resolved", "mark": "page 34"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.71, 1.15, 1.32, 1.44, 2.25, 2.63, 2.74, 2.93]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "But the federal auditor documented six straight filings beyond nine months.", "t0": 29.23, "t1": 33.27, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "6 years", "label": "Federal Data Collection Form submissions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.27, 0.63, 1.03, 1.66, 1.97, 2.32, 2.81, 3.17, 3.42]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The first two filings fell within a federal pandemic extension.", "t0": 33.39, "t1": 36.77, "shot": "pandemic", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "relief", "kicker": "Federal extension", "text": "Six additional months", "mark": "Appendix 3"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.4, 0.61, 1.1, 1.39, 1.66, 1.76, 2.14, 2.62]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The clearinghouse accepted the latest filing on June 22, 2026.", "t0": 36.89, "t1": 41.83, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accept", "kicker": "Federal clearinghouse", "text": "Acceptance date", "mark": "June 22, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.74, 1.2, 1.31, 1.62, 2.15, 2.39, 2.69, 3.64, 4.01]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Management acknowledged the delay and introduced a filing calendar and staff training.", "t0": 41.95, "t1": 45.93, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy25", "kicker": "Management response", "text": "Filing calendar and training", "mark": "corrective action"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.92, 1.03, 1.36, 1.51, 1.97, 2.07, 2.45, 2.84, 2.96, 3.3]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "By August, the city found eight days of operating cash.", "t0": 46.15, "t1": 49.33, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "8 days", "label": "City fiscal monitoring"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.63, 0.74, 1.02, 1.28, 1.5, 1.79, 1.93, 2.41]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Controller lowered the designation to Tier 1 after other findings were resolved.", "t0": 49.45, "t1": 53.79, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "new", "kicker": "October status", "text": "Tier 2 to Tier 1", "mark": "page 29"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.64, 0.94, 1.06, 1.65, 1.79, 2.12, 2.49, 2.85, 3.1, 3.54, 3.72]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The city approved continued housing services at the three hotels.", "t0": 53.91, "t1": 57.31, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "vote", "kicker": "Resolution 615-26", "text": "Three hotels", "mark": "November 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.46, 0.88, 1.33, 1.69, 2.23, 2.41, 2.52, 2.78]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 57.43, "t1": 59.8, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The city deadline", "r": "The federal filing", "s": "The city’s response"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}